  "content": "<h1><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/支持我-Patreon-ff424d?logo=patreon&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8GydmUN3xq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/加入我们的Discord-5865F2?logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"加入我们的Discord\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fquillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/支持我-Ko--fi-571db5?logo=kofi&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"在Ko-fi上支持我\"></a></h1><h1>树木矿工</h1><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/49b1e899a9f41e7eeeb877bc53e8d5838998a95b_0.webp\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a></p><p>一个Minecraft数据包，当你<strong>蹲下并用斧头砍伐原木时</strong>，会自动砍伐整棵树。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1356258/description_fee850f2-e7d4-4760-81b3-acfbe5a851d3.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"225\"></p><h2>说明</h2><ul>\n<li>树木矿工仅在蹲下（潜行）时激活</li>\n<li>如果只想破坏一个方块，请在不蹲下时正常砍伐原木</li>\n<li>树叶会像手动破坏一样掉落正常物品（树苗、木棍）</li>\n<li>每次使用之间有小冷却时间，以防止性能问题</li>\n</ul>",
